Source: lys-wm
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Build-Depends:
 debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/stubbedev/lys-wm
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/stubbedev/lys-wm.git
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/stubbedev/lys-wm

Package: lys-wm
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 fonts-dejavu-core,
 hwdata,
 libegl1,
 libgbm1,
 libgles2,
 libinput10,
 libxkbcommon0
Recommends:
 xwayland,
 xdg-desktop-portal,
 lys-shell,
 libvulkan1,
 mesa-vulkan-drivers
Description: pure-Go tiling Wayland compositor for the lys desktop
 lys-wm is the lys desktop's compositor: a tiling Wayland compositor on
 DRM/KMS through logind and libinput, with Xwayland for X11 clients.
 .
 It installs a lys-wm session for display managers, the
 lys-wm-session.target user unit the session starts, and the portal
 configuration that routes screen sharing and screenshots to lys-shell.
 lys-wmctl queries and drives a running lys-wm over its IPC socket.
